# stale: killed by STALE_HEAD_MUTATION: a changed PR head must HOLD before merge
# family: killed by INDEPENDENT_VERDICT_MUTATION: a self/same-family PASS must HOLD before merge
# check: killed by RED_CHECK_MUTATION: a missing, pending or red required check must HOLD before merge
# thread: killed by BLOCKING_THREAD_MUTATION: an unresolved review thread must HOLD before merge
# explicit: killed by EXPLICIT_HOLD_MUTATION: protected work and explicit holds must never merge
# duplicate: killed by DUPLICATE_MERGE_MUTATION: duplicate ticks and restart must produce no second action
# lost: killed by LOST_RESPONSE_MUTATION: a lost merge response must recover from GitHub without a second merge
# tree: killed by TREE_MISMATCH_MUTATION: completion requires the landed squash tree to equal the approved head tree
